    "detailed_description": "A deckbuilding roguelite played using magical cards!<br>Another Yohane story is here!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/524fc7145421e6700ef58aef21e80fdd.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/524fc7145421e6700ef58aef21e80fdd.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/524fc7145421e6700ef58aef21e80fdd.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0\u300eYohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -\u300f<br>Yohane the Parhelion is an official spin-off of &quot;&quot;Love Live! Sunshine&quot;&quot;. \u300eYohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -\u300f is a deckbuilding roguelite set in that world.<br><br>While working as a fortune teller in Numazu, Yohane spends her days with her friends.<br>By chance, she comes into possession of an old mirror.<br><br>Worried that her fortune-telling isn't accurate, Yohane decides to perform &quot;&quot;Magic Mirror Fortune-Telling&quot;&quot; using it.<br>Suddenly, the mirror begins glowing, and sucks Yohane in!<br><br>What she finds in the mirror is &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu,&quot;&quot; which is a reversed replica of the real Numazu!<br>Moreover, in that mysterious world, magic could be used with the power of cards.<br>At the same time, strange things begin happening to her friends in the real world, one after another.<br>In order to save them, Yohane must go through &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot;!<br>What awaits her?<br><br>A mysterious mirror world that changes each time it's entered.<br>After countless choices, what future will Yohane choose?<br>A new story begins in the other Numazu!<br><br>\u25a0Deckbuilding and card battles in &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot; where magic can be used!<br>Adventure through Numazu in the mirror.<br>Aim for the deepest level of the &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot; by making full use of the cards you have obtained!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/4afe63ae8b1ded923ec3025628dbbbe3.avif?t=1747963176\" /></span><br><br>\u25a0A wide range of deck construction with more than 150 types of cards!<br>Collect cards as you adventure through &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot; and build powerful decks of your own creation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/bae20b491e34dc2700f73b7a6f1df4ea.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/bae20b491e34dc2700f73b7a6f1df4ea.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/bae20b491e34dc2700f73b7a6f1df4ea.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Summon your trusty friends with Summon Cards!<br>You can summon powerful friends in &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot;.<br>Summon Yohane's friends to help you out in a pinch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a02b4f84cb432cee9928049b3805e184.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a02b4f84cb432cee9928049b3805e184.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a02b4f84cb432cee9928049b3805e184.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Prepare for your next adventure at the Fortune-Telling Shack!<br>By completing quests in your adventures, you can power up Yohane!<br>Also, in the 'Closet', you can change into various costumes. <br>By changing initial cards and charms this way, you can acquire abilities that are different from your usual outfit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/937eee800e744864bea36533e4c48124.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/937eee800e744864bea36533e4c48124.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/937eee800e744864bea36533e4c48124.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Endlessly replayable layout-changing maps! There's infinite strategies!?<br>Once cleared, the map changes its layout every time you enter.<br>A bargain system that lets you play forever!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a457dcdb27a40f3a95f759ff39647905.avif?t=1747963176\" /></span><br><br>\u25a0Charms to make you stronger than the strongest! Create your strength with Cards x Charms!<br>&quot;&quot;Charms&quot;&quot; are items with powerful effects.<br>Combine them with your cards to become more powerful than the strongest!",
    "about_the_game": "A deckbuilding roguelite played using magical cards!<br>Another Yohane story is here!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/524fc7145421e6700ef58aef21e80fdd.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/524fc7145421e6700ef58aef21e80fdd.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/524fc7145421e6700ef58aef21e80fdd.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0\u300eYohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -\u300f<br>Yohane the Parhelion is an official spin-off of &quot;&quot;Love Live! Sunshine&quot;&quot;. \u300eYohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -\u300f is a deckbuilding roguelite set in that world.<br><br>While working as a fortune teller in Numazu, Yohane spends her days with her friends.<br>By chance, she comes into possession of an old mirror.<br><br>Worried that her fortune-telling isn't accurate, Yohane decides to perform &quot;&quot;Magic Mirror Fortune-Telling&quot;&quot; using it.<br>Suddenly, the mirror begins glowing, and sucks Yohane in!<br><br>What she finds in the mirror is &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu,&quot;&quot; which is a reversed replica of the real Numazu!<br>Moreover, in that mysterious world, magic could be used with the power of cards.<br>At the same time, strange things begin happening to her friends in the real world, one after another.<br>In order to save them, Yohane must go through &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot;!<br>What awaits her?<br><br>A mysterious mirror world that changes each time it's entered.<br>After countless choices, what future will Yohane choose?<br>A new story begins in the other Numazu!<br><br>\u25a0Deckbuilding and card battles in &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot; where magic can be used!<br>Adventure through Numazu in the mirror.<br>Aim for the deepest level of the &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot; by making full use of the cards you have obtained!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/4afe63ae8b1ded923ec3025628dbbbe3.avif?t=1747963176\" /></span><br><br>\u25a0A wide range of deck construction with more than 150 types of cards!<br>Collect cards as you adventure through &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot; and build powerful decks of your own creation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/bae20b491e34dc2700f73b7a6f1df4ea.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/bae20b491e34dc2700f73b7a6f1df4ea.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/bae20b491e34dc2700f73b7a6f1df4ea.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Summon your trusty friends with Summon Cards!<br>You can summon powerful friends in &quot;&quot;Reverse-Numazu&quot;&quot;.<br>Summon Yohane's friends to help you out in a pinch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a02b4f84cb432cee9928049b3805e184.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a02b4f84cb432cee9928049b3805e184.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a02b4f84cb432cee9928049b3805e184.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Prepare for your next adventure at the Fortune-Telling Shack!<br>By completing quests in your adventures, you can power up Yohane!<br>Also, in the 'Closet', you can change into various costumes. <br>By changing initial cards and charms this way, you can acquire abilities that are different from your usual outfit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/937eee800e744864bea36533e4c48124.poster.avif?t=1747963176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/937eee800e744864bea36533e4c48124.webm?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/937eee800e744864bea36533e4c48124.mp4?t=1747963176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Endlessly replayable layout-changing maps! There's infinite strategies!?<br>Once cleared, the map changes its layout every time you enter.<br>A bargain system that lets you play forever!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459750/extras/a457dcdb27a40f3a95f759ff39647905.avif?t=1747963176\" /></span><br><br>\u25a0Charms to make you stronger than the strongest! Create your strength with Cards x Charms!<br>&quot;&quot;Charms&quot;&quot; are items with powerful effects.<br>Combine them with your cards to become more powerful than the strongest!",
